# Docker reads this, not .gitignore. Without it `COPY . .` carries .env and any
# local data into the build context, and from there into BuildKit's cache.
**/node_modules
**/build
**/bin
**/data
.git
.playwright-cli
**/.env
**/*.pem
# go build run here leaves its binary named after the site.
/dns.bythewood.me
